blog/umbraco-update-umbraco-17-now-in-beta/\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022image image-opacity-100 image_hover-opacity-40\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cpicture\u003E\n\u003Csource data-srcset=\u0022https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/nh5ngawj/wildflowers-7688547_1920.jpg?width=800\u0026amp;height=600\u0026amp;v=1dc077d6186c180\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 1x, https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/nh5ngawj/wildflowers-7688547_1920.jpg?width=1600\u0026amp;height=1200\u0026amp;v=1dc077d6186c180\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 2x\u0022 height=\u0022600\u0022 type=\u0022image/webp\u0022 width=\u0022800\u0022/\u003E\n\u003Cimg alt=\u0022Close up image of some dried out wildflowers\u0022 class=\u0022lazyload\u0022 data-srcset=\u0022https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/nh5ngawj/wildflowers-7688547_1920.jpg?width=800\u0026amp;height=600\u0026amp;v=1dc077d6186c180\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 1x, https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/nh5ngawj/wildflowers-7688547_1920.jpg?width=1600\u0026amp;height=1200\u0026amp;v=1dc077d6186c180\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 2x\u0022 height=\u0022600\u0022 src=\u0022https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/nh5ngawj/wildflowers-7688547_1920.jpg?width=160\u0026amp;height=120\u0026amp;v=1dc077d6186c180\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75\u0022 width=\u0022800\u0022/\u003E\n\u003C/picture\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022info\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022heading md base-heading\u0022\u003EUmbraco update: Umbraco 17 now in beta\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022text base-text\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003EUmbraco 17 is now in beta. In this brief post we explore what is in the new release as well as its expected rollout timetable.\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003